decisions:
  - id: TD-2026-10-20-514
    decision: One presence per card decision, root-class included
    rationale: 'Founder: 4 passwords per install is unacceptable'
  - id: TD-2026-10-21-077
    decision: Session PATH from root-signed config or a fixed default
    rationale: PATH differed by launch path; after an upgrade it lost /opt/homebrew/bin
  - id: TD-2026-10-21-162
    decision: Write-deny user-writable PATH dirs; brew install via a card
    rationale: 'Aegis: planting persistence vector'
errors_encountered:
  - description: Sessions refused not_subscription_auth after a daemon self-upgrade
    resolution: Session identity env from os.userInfo(), not the daemon env
  - description: Subagents repeatedly hit 20-50 turn caps
    resolution: The installed plugin cache was stale; released 7.15.1 with maxTurns 100 to main
learnings:
  - 'Count presence prompts as a cost: the spec budgeted 2 per root card, and the implementation spent 4-7.'
  - 'A clean re-exec env silently changes child behaviour: anything a child needs from identity must come from the OS, not the env.'
  - A repo change to plugin agent files does nothing until it is on main with a plugin.json bump.
